      "biography": {
        "value": "<h2>Grand Library Librarian</h2><p>Librarians preserve the catalogs, lend audience tokens, maintain reading wards, and remember the movement of books better than people. Their jangling brass keys open small departmental doors, not the main gate.</p><p><strong>Roleplay:</strong> Courteous but exacting; values quiet and proper documentation. Can offer the party a research lead concerning the time artifact without revealing its entire secret.</p><p><strong>Combat:</strong> AC 11, HP 13, improvised dagger +3 to hit, 1d4+1 piercing. Prefers to call guards and flee.</p>"
      }
